audio.cpp fork delta on the Vulkan backend, captured 2026-09-23 (previously
untracked in external/ggml - see 0008's header). Source commit: audio.cpp #542
(54026af7, fix-vulkan-col2im-1d-dispatch).

  - COL2IM_1D: clamp the x element count to maxComputeWorkGroupCount[0] *
    wg_denoms[0] (the shader already strides over the remainder) instead of
    dispatching ne0*ne1 elements in x, which exceeded the per-dimension
    workgroup limit on large outputs.

History: this patch was captured with a second fix, audio.cpp #508 (43833e87,
"Apply upstream Vulkan fill dispatch fix": FILL on a 2D workgroup grid,
fill.comp flattening, non-empty asserts in ARANGE/FILL). Upstream ggml 0.24.0
(456172ec) carries that fix verbatim, so those three hunks were retired in the
same session they were captured. On every bump, check whether upstream has
converged on the COL2IM_1D clamp too, and retire this patch once it has.

